-off is outside the window but still runs the stage, at most 116.5 W under the backstop's current trip (R-175); the cut-off cannot go below CS101's 27.82 V input peak without a different immunity basis. Owed: the LCSC codes of D4 and of the Samsung parts, U21's DGX-19 land, the regeneration and the bench rows (R-176). The guard adds protection and changes no topology.
