     Storage limits: approved 1 month -20 to 60 C, 3 months -20 to 45 C, 1 year -20 to 25 C at 30 %, recovery over 80 % (GUARANTEED) | Saft the window: allowable -40 to +85 C, recommended +15 to +30 C (GUARANTEED); the dwell (24 h at +71 C and at -33 C at 30 %, E5's rest) and the recovery, none printed: AWAITING Saft or the sample qualification
